<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post3006140574646913787..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: Cold War II: This Time, The Commies Are In Washington</title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3006140574646913787/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/03/in-new-cold-war-commies-are-in.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>8</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7377159480023515434</id><published>2015-03-24T20:35:35.251-06:00</published><updated>2015-03-24T20:35:35.251-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Reblogged!&#xa;&#xa;Great work (as usual) Will!</title><content type='html'>Reblogged!&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Great work (as usual) Will!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3006140574646913787/comments/default/7377159480023515434'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3006140574646913787/comments/default/7377159480023515434'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/03/in-new-cold-war-commies-are-in.html?showComment=1427250935251#c7377159480023515434' title=''/><author><name>4threvolutionarywar</name><uri>https://4threvolutionarywar.wordpress.com/</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/openid16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/03/in-new-cold-war-commies-are-in.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3006140574646913787' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3006140574646913787' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-133211852"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 24, 2015 at 8:35 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8208035523034640434</id><published>2015-03-22T11:43:29.653-06:00</published><updated>2015-03-22T11:43:29.653-06:00</updated><title type='text'>&amp;quot;How, then, were the Iraqi guerillas to be de...</title><content type='html'>&amp;quot;How, then, were the Iraqi guerillas to be described, since the term “insurgents” was forbidden?&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;They have stretched and abused the word &amp;quot;terrorist&amp;quot; to mean anyone who fights without government permission.    By their definition the Resistance in France and the Partisans in Eastern Europe were terrorists. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I haven&amp;#39;t quite figured out how attacking military units is cowardly and an act of terrorism, but being a sniper is brave and worthy of praise.&lt;br /&gt;I also haven&amp;#39;t figured out how burning a man alive in a cage is wrong, but dropping napalm or white phosphorus  on people is a sound military tactic.  &lt;br /&gt;How is using an IED cowardly and terrorism, but using cluster bombs, artillery,mines and missiles from drones not?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Maybe it would make sense if I was a hypocrite. But then I remember, Jesus seemed to save his worst for when he was talking to hypocrites.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3006140574646913787/comments/default/8208035523034640434'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3006140574646913787/comments/default/8208035523034640434'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/03/in-new-cold-war-commies-are-in.html?showComment=1427046209653#c8208035523034640434' title=''/><author><name>Chris Mallory</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/13001920155309388738</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='31' height='25' src='http://4.bp.blogspot.com/-DTy4v_qd_7s/Uy823oj8mgI/AAAAAAAAAFg/PkIaN0O1D-w/s220/images.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/03/in-new-cold-war-commies-are-in.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3006140574646913787' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3006140574646913787' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1685275614"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 22, 2015 at 11:43 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1415129534276262676</id><published>2015-03-21T18:36:19.352-06:00</published><updated>2015-03-21T18:36:19.352-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Will,&#xa;&#xa;I no longer have an email address to corres...</title><content type='html'>Will,&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I no longer have an email address to correspond with you, so please forgive me lurching into this thread.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;You need to take a look at this.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;http://www.usatoday.com/story/news/nation/2015/03/21/immigrant-police-officers/70236828/&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;In the meantime, it was very good to visit with you again briefly a week or so ago.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Walt</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3006140574646913787/comments/default/1415129534276262676'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3006140574646913787/comments/default/1415129534276262676'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/03/in-new-cold-war-commies-are-in.html?showComment=1426984579352#c1415129534276262676' title=''/><author><name>ebeye</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/07271431868921691515</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/03/in-new-cold-war-commies-are-in.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3006140574646913787' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3006140574646913787' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-527221346"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 21, 2015 at 6:36 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1252995520543271958</id><published>2015-03-21T08:55:27.703-06:00</published><updated>2015-03-21T08:55:27.703-06:00</updated><title type='text'>“...individuals and entities to be sanctioned over...</title><content type='html'>“...individuals and entities to be sanctioned over Russia’s interference in Ukraine.” &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;this particular jewel of lying doublespeak can only be uttered where those listening are incredibly naive, overtly stupid, voluntarily misinformed or bought-and-paid-for.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;when will we sanction those who have done all that has been done to us?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3006140574646913787/comments/default/1252995520543271958'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3006140574646913787/comments/default/1252995520543271958'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/03/in-new-cold-war-commies-are-in.html?showComment=1426949727703#c1252995520543271958' title=''/><author><name>kirk</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/03/in-new-cold-war-commies-are-in.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3006140574646913787' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3006140574646913787' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1239096284"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 21, 2015 at 8:55 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-878961635336035021</id><published>2015-03-20T10:13:09.152-06:00</published><updated>2015-03-20T10:13:09.152-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Cap&amp;#39;n, I was thinking along very similar lines...</title><content type='html'>Cap&amp;#39;n, I was thinking along very similar lines as I wrote the essay. Dugin is about my age, and I&amp;#39;ve never met (or corresponded with) a Russian of that vintage who has anything but contempt for Communism, or any desire to start a war with America. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;While there is much in Dugin&amp;#39;s philosophy I don&amp;#39;t like (nationalism and absolutism of any variety don&amp;#39;t appeal to me as an individualist), he&amp;#39;s not a diabolical proponent of continental or world conquest. That&amp;#39;s Washington&amp;#39;s gig, not Moscow&amp;#39;s. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3006140574646913787/comments/default/878961635336035021'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3006140574646913787/comments/default/878961635336035021'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/03/in-new-cold-war-commies-are-in.html?showComment=1426867989152#c878961635336035021' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='24' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-a8aojUJZY3w/VLgkHDf4rTI/AAAAAAAALNc/ZNKtkMla2UU/s220/Snapshot_20150115_3.JPG'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/03/in-new-cold-war-commies-are-in.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3006140574646913787' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3006140574646913787' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 20, 2015 at 10:13 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7055518976002899491</id><published>2015-03-20T10:05:20.069-06:00</published><updated>2015-03-20T10:05:20.069-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Will...Kirk Bolas here. Galatians 4:16 came to min...</title><content type='html'>Will...Kirk Bolas here. Galatians 4:16 came to mind as I read your piece, &amp;quot;Have I then become your enemy by telling you the truth? (‭Galatians‬ ‭4‬:‭16‬ ESV)</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3006140574646913787/comments/default/7055518976002899491'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3006140574646913787/comments/default/7055518976002899491'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/03/in-new-cold-war-commies-are-in.html?showComment=1426867520069#c7055518976002899491' title=''/><author><name>Fendersuperchamp1963</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/01336384697479095113</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/03/in-new-cold-war-commies-are-in.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3006140574646913787' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3006140574646913787' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-295794418"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 20, 2015 at 10:05 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-686768006662783543</id><published>2015-03-20T08:59:03.144-06:00</published><updated>2015-03-20T08:59:03.144-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I notice that the Realtor was working on behalf of...</title><content type='html'>I notice that the Realtor was working on behalf of Fannie Mae, which is, for all intents and purposes, the federal housing soviet. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3006140574646913787/comments/default/686768006662783543'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3006140574646913787/comme